RTED\",\"evidence\":\"but not on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a cap is not raised on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-065\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Bring a week of refusal counts\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text asks for a week of refusal counts with an increase request.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-066\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the shape of the traffic across the day\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text lists the shape of the traffic across the day among the items to bring.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-067\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the deadline that traffic is serving\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text lists the deadline the traffic is serving among the items to bring.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-068\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the team checks whether the load is smooth or bursty before looking at the number.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-069\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states that a burst is cheaper to smooth than to serve at its peak.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-070\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states that requests reach the platform team through the usual channel.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-071\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no expedited path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\